  "title": "Colgate-Palmolive India Announces Leadership Changes",
  "summary": "Colgate-Palmolive India has appointed Manish Anandani as managing director and chief executive officer, while Kenvue's executive team will take over as MD and CEO. Anandani will lead Colgate-Palmolive India after his previous role at Kenvue.",
